# variants/kits/desktops/gnome — the GNOME desktop (2026-10-03).
#
# gnome-light, not gnome: the shell, the session, Settings, Files (nautilus) and a
# terminal, without the full application set (gnome-core-apps and gnome-extra-apps:
# epiphany, evolution, two editors, two image viewers, 17 games, tracker...). The
# ISO already ships its own browser, mail client and media players; applications
# are chosen here, as kits/desktops/kde does on top of Plasma.
#
# gdm is the display manager under both inits: gdm.service under systemd, the
# display-manager service with DISPLAYMANAGER="gdm" under OpenRC (system.yaml).
#
# NOTE when curating: `graphics` gives every graphical flavor media-video/mpv but
# NOT media-video/vlc -- vlc-4 is a Qt6/KDE-Frameworks application now, so it sits
# in flavor/kde/sets/kde. If this flavor wants a full-featured player, pick the
# native one (media-video/totem) rather than pulling Qt6+KF6 in for vlc alone.
#
# LEAF set: a flat list of atoms (2026-09-09). See kits/core/base for the layering contract.

gnome-base/gdm
gnome-base/gnome-light
